<title>Algorithm for Determining Treating Setting for Patient with an Eating Disorder.</title>
<graphic href="eee0620-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Medically stable (no IV fluids, nasogastric tube feedings, or multiple laboratory tests)</label>
<path target="cell-2">No</path>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-2">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Suicidal plan or intent.</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>Percent of healthy body weight &lt;80&#x0025;.</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-7">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>Motivation to recover fair to good.</label>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-9">
<label>Comorbid disorder requiring hospitalization.</label>
<path target="cell-10">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-11">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-10">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-11">
