<label>Able to care for self and avoid over exercising.</label>
<path target="cell-14">No</path>
<path target="cell-15">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-14">
<label>Consider hospitalization&#x002F;residential treatment.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-15">
